  "body": "Supersedes 0.3.1, which published the same features under a patch version number minutes earlier.\n\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.4.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Features\n* feat: warn when servers.toml keeps a credential as a literal value by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/146\n* feat: send static per-server headers from servers.toml by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/147\n* feat(mcp): take credentials from env vars or a named server by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/148\n* feat(tui): reattach to a running task and attach to any task by ID by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/149\n* feat: save received files and data to disk, and describe file-only replies by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/150\n### Other changes\n* CI, lint, tests, and release provenance polish by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/151\n* ci: attach only the wheel and sdist to the GitHub release by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/153\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/compare/v0.3.0...v0.4.0\n",
